# Social Snub: cast while Bot1 controls Ornithopter, its trigger lets Bot1 copy it (CR 707.10). The copy resolves first: each
# player sacrifices an Ornithopter, Bot2 loses 1 and Bot1 gains 1. The original then resolves with no creature left on either side
# to sacrifice (a player with none sacrifices nothing), and drains once more: Bot2 18, Bot1 22.

